OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is Gloucester City Council
OL,4,Astill leaderless?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week Gloucester City Council
OL,7,Fdecided to vote out its leader, and no
OL,8,Fone could decide who should replace
OL,9,Fhim.
OL,11,FJeremy Hilton lost not one but two
OL,12,Fvotes following an immediate attempt to
OL,13,Fget him re-elected - the cabinet then
OL,14,Fresigned en masse.
OL,16,FThe events came after financial
OL,17,Fchallenges, and accusations of a toxic
OL,18,Fculture and bullying.
OL,20,FThe council remains leaderless but
OL,21,Fofficers are keeping things ticking
OL,22,Falong for now.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
